<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">2TIh 2DIh EN_ULT en_English_ltr Fri Feb 21 2020 15:52:34 GMT-0500 (EST) tc</book>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">2 Timothy</para>
  <para style="toc1">Paul ne Timothy dage raukegai laisu kenabe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Timothy Kenabe</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tim.</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Timothy</para>
  <para style="mt">Paul ne Timothy dage raukegai laisu kenabe</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul Timothy keraibe penai Titus laisiu rau kedicai pecu tui daidi kecu nzwa, nah pa Timothy dage kekai kenabe de Rome baangki gade hebaang tei kebamdau raugai kecu nzwa. Laisiu aikade kengau Paul hebaangki gade mpetlu kera rehi camkedi ngaudi nah pa tsai zette di kera cidi. Makie aidung ziemne pa Timothy dage raugai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul au Timothy de ngaugai daineu kecu rünne ma dede Timothy de teingkuu neudi, kedanemene pa Paul tsai kedicai pe zierang ta tei jüja la maikesiane.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io">Kelumkegai (1:1-2)</para>
  <para style="io">Samsang lulo eh teingkuu kegai (1:3-2:13)</para>
  <para style="io">Paul Timothy de teingkuu kegai (3:10-4:8)</para>
  <para style="io">Kekambe (4:9-22)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="s">Samkeraibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Paul, Khrista Jisu da kebam kering sampet de ziemne, Tinggwang lungning gade Khrista Jisu ne langkegaibe ne raupwa, <verse eid="2TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />kehung a na Timothy dage kekai: Peibe Tinggwang nah anui Rampaube Khrista Jisu dade kegwang ngaugia, keku nah lungciep de peu n da bam kelu teilo.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masang lulo eh kecungkegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Ih lungcet kemci teu eh a paume gade pe gwatei kela Tinggwang de Ih hetwa peula, Ih a kekie gade ncu tingmui tingba nsung bamla, <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Ih n miakduidung de nsung eh ncu kerengau neusüt bamla, iciu eh Ih suiyi le puilu kerane. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Ih n kenlum lungsang kecude nsung bamla, n pai Lois nah n pui Eunice da bamrai kelu kenlumde, nah n dade kenlum cide bam kera Ih cisiak bamlie. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Aide ziemne, Ih nreu gage a ba hwa kegai gade Tinggwang mapeu n da kebamde peu heubam lulo de ncu rang nsunggai daila. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Kedanemene Tinggwang anuide kengngi rabe peu ma, dede kengkieng, keku nah samzai ketei rabe peu. <verse eid="2TI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Ciziemne, nnui Rampaube zierang tei ngngam diso, mede Ih pe baang tei kelabe ziemne de ngngam diso, dede Tinggwang kengkieng kepeu nzwa samliakeyi de ziemne keherei kecuga ncüt lulo. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Pa anuide kelilu nah anuide kemci gage qu gailu da—anui batadung rehi gade ma, dede pe mariem nah pe ngaugia rehi gade, pa ndaa raitu gade Khrista Jisu dade pe ngaugia anuide peuda, <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />dede cu au cide anuide Kelikelube Khrista Jisu mi miakngau tei kegwang gade anuide keulia dida. Pa ketsai kengkieng de penli tei dida, nah samliakeyi de gade pa tsaidi kelak teilung de keulia dida, <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />cide ziemne Tinggwang peu acu langkegaime ge zielie nah samliakeyi paulia kelame ge nah keledeume ge tei zielie kedetlu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung ga, </char><char style="fqa">Gentileme ziemne, de kecu de kaisi. </char> </note> <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />aide ziemne Ih ma aidungde gade keherei lala. Dede Ih ngngamdi lama, kedanemene Ih nlum kelabe de Ih ci, nah pa acu nlum kebeude cipau tingba de gwangcang kemaktane kaikwak bamlu kenui Ih cisiakte bam. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Kesang sam nang a dade siu keludung de mzai siakte bamlu, nah Khrista Jisu da kebam kenlum nah keku ga bamlu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Anui lungga kebam Kemci Rabe gade ncu nlum kebeu makeyi de kwa siakte bamlu.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Asia ga kebam keheibe de nah cipaume kakde Phygelus penai Hermogenes de si eh a dade nreutet kedi nang cibam. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Peu Rampaube de Onesiphorus kilungme de ngaunggia beu kelube tei lulo, kedanemene pa gwang a lung taumla bam muila, nah Ih hebaang tei kebamde ziemne ngngam dila melu, <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />dede pa Rome ga gwang keludau pa acu ngaulu kemaktane peei. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Peu Rampaube de cipau tingba benai pecu Rampaube dade ngaugia ngau kelube tei lulo. Nah Ephesus gade pa dai kenzwa ge ngha gaibi nang ci hemisüt bam.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />A na, nang au Khrista Jisu dade kepet ngaugiabe ga ngkieng sap lulo. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Ih mina kekiee dwa ga ranglia kecu nang siukelu keledeu samdung de teupwa mide ledeu swalu kebuime samsang kelame dage nlum beulo. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Jisu Khrista reugwa keyime ge nzwa keherei kecuga acu ngngwa n qwa pwalu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Reugwame pe ta teikela gade kideu aika bata keda gede teisi lama, iciu eh pa pecu qu kelube suiyi teilu kerane. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Cinzwa eh kenggwame keheibe kerenia ga hezaidung mzui eh renialu mecai pa pe ziehi ngaulu lama. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Nrisüt eh heta ketabe luhlüt keyi ngau raitu kerabe. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Ih kerangde cet gailo, kedanemene Rampaube ncu peu ma pelane cilu kebui maci peu zielu. <verse eid="2TI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Ih zierang tei kegai samliakeyi de nzwa eh Jisu Khrista, ketsai gade teucuh kelu, hegwangpei David leuh gade lunggwang kelube de nsung lulo, <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />cipau samliakeyi de ziemne Ih kemau keteime nzwa keherei eh hebaang teibam. Dede Tinggwang samde au kangdi ma. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Aide ziemne, Ih makeheibe de kedet kelume ziemne lia eh lala, iciu eh penuide peu Khrista Jisu dade kegwang kelikelu de nah kelungta kendu de ngaulu kerane. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Sam aide au nlumlukebui ge:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">“Anui pecu ngngwa tsaidi cai, anui pecu ngngwa ring de luzie.<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Anui liabam lucai, anui de pecu ngngwa hegwang teizie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Anui pecu mlai dicai, pa de anuide mlai dizie.<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Anui masang melu liede, pa au masang bam muila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:13">kedanemene pa pekatei pecu mlaidi laklu.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tinggwang pesui kelu hetame</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Penuide ma aidungde ranglia daibeu lulo, Tinggwang dwade penuide kesamlim helo kecu ranglia beu lulo; cide makeyi gede teibeu lama, dede kekingneime de teimsia dila. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Tinggwang de peu ncu yilie lu kerane n laikai tei lulo, kesangsam teu ledeu siakte eh heta teikelame ge ngngamdi kerabe ma. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Sam keherabe nah kemtabe sam kerangdung gade mbailu, cide mide kesangbe gade gwa mdei reureu dila, <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />nah penui sam au hezam keteei nzwa teei mdi reureu dila, cidung kakgade Hymenaeus penai Philetus de si da, <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />penai kesangbe gade nreu tet dida. Penai ringcuh dai kecu de au gwang kedibe ha ge dide lei eh midung ge kenlum tei maula dida. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Ciuliede, Tinggwang kengkieng tsubam de ga aide rauteu eh sap ntiprip bam: “Rampaube au pe mina de ci” nah “Keheibe de Rampaube zi teukelame kemau gade nreu tetdi maisia.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NAM 1:7">Nah. 1:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Ki kedi ga kecak nah rangkanggeu li rünne bamla ma, dede tsing li nah tangnia li de bamla, nah kesa kemlangta ziemne nah kesa naimsangne ta ziemne. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Ciziemne, keheibe de aidungde gade pecu tei mci lucai, pa kemlang li ge tei luzie, nah pecu teimci lwe pe mpaube pecu keupwa mata keyi leune tei kera mtei luzie. <verse eid="2TI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Cine hangleime hengindung gade paklu, delwe penui lung mci eh Rampaube de qu kelame de nzang eh kesamsang, kenlum, keku, nah lungciep aidungde gwazui lalu. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Dede kemie nah kemta kesamlimdung gade mbai lulo, kedanemene cidungde kengaurau kecu teu gwangbeu kela nang cibam lu. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Dede Rampaube kilame kesamlim kerabe ma, dede mi pelane dade mizai yi, ledeulu kebuime, mi lungtie, <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />nciep eh mi ngauraume de ledeu kerabe. Kedanemene Tinggwang penuide peu helung nreulwe kesangbe cilu kera zuiyikeyi peulu builu, <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />nah iciu eh penui mcing gwang dailwe herakesiabe, pe lungning tei kerane pa penuide tuipwa kebambe tak gade pak luzie.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Kekamle Tinggwang miehing tadi zie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Peting kekamle bie keherei kecu ting gwang kera ci lulo. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Kedanemene mina pekatei pe ziu ci, rangkang hengin, hegie, helia, mide rangkemsia, mipui mipei samzai tei kemak, leirau kegah, mci kemak, <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />mide ku kemak, kezuyi kegah, sam kesia kerang, mide ketip kemak, zaisiet, keyi ngau ngkau, <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />mide cwa, pe suira ketei, ngang, nah penui Tinggwang de swade penui hengindung de hungki dizie, <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />penui hegwazu gade renet mzui zie, dede pe kengkieng de mlai dizie. Mina ci kenzwame dade nreutet dilu. <verse eid="2TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Kedanemene mina cidung kakga midung ge mi kidung ga lütlwe mipui mriak kemakme, penui hengindung le penuide cwateu eh kemaudung le kepui tei kelame de cwala dida, <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />mipui cidungde ma cilu kerane peei lamui lala, dede penui madaude kesangbe maci ci gailak. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Jannes penai Jambres<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jannes nah Jambres: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Penai kehemeu ta keteime Moses de mlai kedibe kena lie nlum la. </char></note> Moses de ngaurau kedi nzwa, cinzwa mina aidungde kesangbe de ngaurau la, mina penui lungcet kemaume, penui kenlum lamde kesang kemakme.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:8">Bat. 13:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Dede penui pak mdeisüt gailak da, kedanemene mina aipau kenade nzwa, penui kemiede mina pelane da ci petdi zielu.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul Timothy de teingkuu kegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Dede nang au a keledeu sam, a zaireli, mariem, kenlum, helungketie, keku, liakelu, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />teikeherei kecu nah keherei kecudung cibam, nah a dage Antioch, Iconium, nah Lystra gade dai teigai bi nah Ih keherei dai kenzwadung lia lubi nang cibam. Ciuliede, Rampaube cidung pelane gade acu kelibeu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:19">Lei. 34:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Nah kesang, mina keheibe de Khrista Jisu gade masang eh lungh keneume de teikeherei zie. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Dede mina kesiame nah mide cwakelame mide cwa nah penuikatei penuide cwa eh siaki reureu dizie. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Ciuliede nang au, nang ci kelude nah ntiprip eh nlum keludungde ga bamlu, kedanemene nang ncu ledeu kebeume de ci bamlu, <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />nah n henane gade nang kesanglaisiu ci luda, cide ne Khrista Jisu da kebam kenlumde gade kelikelu ngaulu kera maci ncu peu lubui. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Kesanglaisiu pelane Tinggwang ne ngngi gaibeu, nah cide keledeu ziemne, mide kehesiu ziemne, mide tei kemzui ziemne, nah mide kecung pwa tei masanglu kera ziemne pe keyi bam, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />iciu eh Tinggwang gwatei kelabe de peu yicanglu eh bata keyi leune teilu kerane.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Ih Tinggwang nah ketsaime nah keringme tutiak kerabe Khrista Jisu dwa gade, nah pa gwang kera nah pe hegwangram ziemne, n dage rang sünne gaila: <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />Samliakeyi de ledeulu; peting daude nah peting kemak daude mteilu; helungtie eh mi mau ranglia, kesiu, nah kecung eh ledeulu. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Kedanemene minadung kesangbe keledeu de kingneineu tadi kecu ting ge gwang zie. Dede, penui lungningbe rünne mzui eh penui ziemne keledeume peei zie, penui kingnei keneube ledeu lu kebuime de, <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />nah penui kesangbe gade nreu tetdi zie, nah penui nreu pwa kemta sam kerangle ge penui lung kai dizie. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Dede nang au, kehei daude mriak eh bamlu. Keherei kecu ga n qwa pwalu. Samliakeyi kepau tade tei eh n ta tei canglu. <verse eid="2TI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Kedanemene, acu au reca ge nzwa ruigai pwabam dida,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Reca ge nzwa ruigai pwabam dida: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paul pa tsaidi kera ting nnadi delie kecu kenlum aide, Timothy de peu pe ta ga samsang nah nri eh teilu kera ziemne kecung gai. </char></note> nah Ih kideu aikade tetdi kera ting gwangbam dida. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Ih kerenia gade a laikai tei süt dida; Ih hezu kemzu de mzu cang luda; Ih kenlum de kainzeu luda. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Cu au a ziemne kesamsang hegwang peurwa mtei pwabam dida, cide Rampaube, kesamsang tutiakbe, cipaunai a ziehi peuzie, nah acu rünne ma, dede pa gwang kera pesui eh kwa kebamme pelane de ziehi peuzie.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timothy ziemne sam kekambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Nang mzet eh a da gwanglu kera n laikai tei lulo, <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />kedanemene Demas cudau teilung gudung hengin eh acu püt dida, nah Thessalonica ga mie dida, Crescens Galatia ga nah Titus Dalmatia ga mie dida. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Luke rünne acu ngngwa bam. Mark de ngngwalwe gwanglu, kedanemene pa a bata ga acu nghalu builu. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Dede Ih Tychicus de Ephesus namdi gage langgai dida. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Nang gwang kecu dau Ih a pai Troas ga Carpus dage kai kenzeu de keu gwanglu, nah laisiukwakdung de, bamkeraide teihgeu laisiudung de keu gwanglu. <verse eid="2TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Alexander hegeu ta keteibe a dage makesia teisüt gai. Rampaube pe bata nzwa pe ziehi peuzie. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Nangde pe dade mriaklu, kedanemene pa anui samdung de ngkausüt lalu. <verse eid="2TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />A nzeurang keraidau gade, migede acu ngngwa sap ma, dede pelane acu pütdi. Peu cide lepwa penuide mmaudi helo. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Dede Rampaube acu ngngwa sap eh acu tei ngkieng beu, iciu eh a dade samliakeyi pau cangsiaklu kerane nah Gentileme pelane cide siulu kerane. Nah Tinggwang hinghodung mzeu kebam dade acu kelikebeu nzwa acu ketsai gade kelibeu. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Rampaube kesia ta pelane gade acu kelibeu zie nah acu pe tinggim hegwangram ziemne kelibeu zie. Pecu peu kelungta ndu kelube tei lulo. Amen.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kelumkegai kekambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Priscilla penai Aquila, nah Onesiphorus kilungme de kelum gailo. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Erastus Corinth namdi ga bam dida, nah Trophimus mra kedine Ih Miletus namdi gage pütnzeu dida. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Tingtiak dwa nang teilu kebui tane gwang lulo. Eubulus, Pudens, Linus, Claudia, nah sinamedung ncu kelum gaila.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Rampaube de peu n rabe de ngngwa bamlu. Tinggwang ngaugia nnui peciakne da peu bam kelube tei lulo.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>